      "source": "Used internally by Spring's <a href=\"JtaTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.jta\"><code>JtaTransactionManager</code></a> for certain\nscenarios. Not intended for direct use in application code.",
      "translation": "由 Spring 的<a href=\"JtaTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.jta\"><code>JtaTransactionManager</code></a>内部用于某些场景。不打算在应用程序代码中直接使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The JTA UserTransaction interface is an exact subset of the JTA\nTransactionManager interface. Unfortunately, it does not serve as\nsuper-interface of TransactionManager, though, which requires an\nadapter such as this class to be used when intending to talk to\na TransactionManager handle through the UserTransaction interface.",
      "translation": "JTA UserTransaction 接口是 JTA TransactionManager 接口的精确子集。不幸的是，它并不是 TransactionManager 的超接口，因此当试图通过 UserTransaction 接口与 TransactionManager 句柄通信时，需要使用此类适配器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new UserTransactionAdapter for the given TransactionManager.",
      "translation": "为给定的 TransactionManager 创建一个新的 UserTransactionAdapter。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the JTA TransactionManager that this adapter delegates to.",
      "translation": "返回该适配器委托的 JTA TransactionManager。",
      "count": 2
    },
